ant"],[["點了醬油拉麵，雞白湯拉麵，炸雞跟煎餃。醬油拉麵（260元）湯頭跟拉麵表現一般，沒有記憶點，雞白湯拉麵（360元）薄薄三片雞肉，湯頭像比較濃的雞湯，麵條口感一般，拉麵沒有太多料及特色，收費價格跟品質不成正比，這份量男生肯定吃不飽，炸雞三塊（120元）， 煎餃6顆（130元），往前看評論知道這家是抄襲法國知名拉麵店有些失望，如果要模仿 ，是否在品質上也追求卓越，而讓人沒話說 ，這是店家該考量的，如無改善不會再回訪，謝謝。",null,[0,210]]]],[null,1719708241000000,1719708241000000,"2 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfQm04QzJCb0J0WDFtZ0twUkFBbTMyQQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfQm04QzJCb0J0WDFtZ0twUkFBbTMyQRoTQ2d3STBkU0N0QVlRdy1PX3JBSQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiaj8qpw9KWAxWXYfUHHbMCLo4Q_2MI5gIoCw"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1866122680876020594/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTk1iVFJmYkZSbkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1866122680876020594/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTk1iVFJmYkZSbkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1866122680876020594/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTk1iVFJmYkZSbkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1866122680876020594/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTk1iVFJmYkZSbkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1866122680876020594/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTk1iVFJmYkZSbkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1866122680876020594/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTk1iVFJmYkZSbkVBRRAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝",null,[0,2]]]],[null,null,5029,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNMbTRfbFRnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x6af6f4f749f6519c!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICLm4_lTg%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNMbTRfbFRnEAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNMbTRfbFRnEi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ0xtNF9semdFEhNDZ3dJck83ZnN3WVFpUFd1NGdFGi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ0xtNF9sTGcSE0Nnd0k0LTdmc3dZUXdJR3V